{
  "name": "Sun Shield",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can expend 4 Ki Points as an Action and become wreathed in a luminous, magical aura for 10 minutes. You shed bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. This light counts as sunlight. You can extinguish or restore the light as a Bonus Action.</p><p>If a creature hits you with a melee attack while this light shines, it takes radiant damage equal to a roll of your Martial Arts die.</p>",
